User_147979: Can I also change my airport? My flight to KL is from Bali, but I would like to have it on the same date from Singapore. Is that possible?
AirAsiaSupport: Hi There, sorry, but route change is not allowed. Only flight change time/date is possible. Thank you. -Prabu

