User_227745: I have always booked a min of 2 tickets other one for the kid...this time Air Asia will not let my kid sit with parents unless more money is paid?
User_227745: Care to respond assholes
AirAsiaSupport: Hope it clarify - See you!- Anwar
AirAsiaSupport: in order to avoid any hassle or misunderstanding and as a parent we don't wish our child to be seat with a stranger too :) &gt;&gt;&gt;
AirAsiaSupport: on the lowest seat fare if available :) We appreciate you can do add on seat in the future when you traveling with children&gt;&gt;&gt;
AirAsiaSupport: with your child but bear in mind,as most of our flight seat is always almost full and they can only assign you&gt;&gt;&gt;
AirAsiaSupport: if they are traveling with a children And yes, of course our staff is kind to arrange you a seat with 1 Adult to be seated
AirAsiaSupport: the seat will be assigned randomly when you do web check in ,hence we always encourage guest to do an add on seat &gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;
AirAsiaSupport: Hi Manish :) Oh no! We apologize on that bad experience For your kind information, if you don't do any add on seat, &gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;

